 sides for $3. They also have a nice salad bar and freshly made sushi. And nearby is a Menchie's and PJ's."},{"business_id":"6MBVjXPYjlNkIcNzlChEsA","review_id":"vsSTHg8doC3xTo24t7njug","date":"2017-07-13T18:27:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.928699254989624,"text_excerpt":"Great food and staff. I had the lentils the other day and it was tasty! You can never go wrong eating breakfast here. You can split breakfast with a friend."},{"business_id":"6MBVjXPYjlNkIcNzlChEsA","review_id":"05UN69_5t3d_Jsat3nyKog","date":"2019-01-25T20:02:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9234452843666077,"text_excerpt":"Time for an update.... The cafeteria management is definitely stepping up their game. Recently there has been a sushi chef working and you can get handmade rolls and/or a poke bowl! The Action station often has tasty salads and other customizable options. Breakfast continues to be a really good deal. And there are now fancy drink machines so I can fulfill my lime coke needs, as well as 3 different iced tea dispensers. They are really responsive to requests and the staff is great. I am sad that don't have the fried okra waiting for me anymore but did I really need it anyway?"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
